    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the dungeons and try to find and save the <strong>Queen Yuma</strong>... but wait: it's almost an impossible dungeon. And why? Because it's easy to say: you must move two knights at once!!! Are you ready to find and save tons of girls without dying?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620020/extras/b9a66927516ada218d1d16765e185282.poster.avif?t=1740322085\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620020/extras/b9a66927516ada218d1d16765e185282.webm?t=1740322085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620020/extras/b9a66927516ada218d1d16765e185282.mp4?t=1740322085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAIN FEATURES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time action game (like roguelike) with simple puzzle\u00a0solving mechanics;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 controller/keyboard allows the player to\u00a0move 2 characters\u00a0simultaneously;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 languages available (italian, english, french, german, spanish, japanese, simplified chinese, traditional chinese, russian);</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24 levels, 8 rest areas and 4 bosses;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 available\u00a0items (unlockable by winning) that allows you to boost your characters;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >96 girls to rescue across dungeons.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620020/extras/e8f465af8aeec34d58e0ac2014db4ec1.poster.avif?t=1740322085\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620020/extras/e8f465af8aeec34d58e0ac2014db4ec1.webm?t=1740322085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620020/extras/e8f465af8aeec34d58e0ac2014db4ec1.mp4?t=1740322085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OTHER FEATURES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So... HARD!!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character got unique special move (activable by spending coins);</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Normal/hard difficulty\u00a0(plus chicken mode for beginner - hard difficulty has inverted movement);</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gambling system to get items.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Too difficult? Try the Easy <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620020/extras/4646964692e7d185c5d9fb6a93ea0169.webp?t=1740322085\" width=17 height=19 /></span> &quot;Chicken&quot; Mode</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before leaving a bad review (cause bug or game features), send me an e-mail at <a href=\"mailto:ashandtoryumaquest@gmail.com\">ashandtoryumaquest@gmail.com</a>, and I will improve the game as you wish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't be too harsh, it's my very first game! <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620020/extras/254718f75ded2dd4b11b528ac3bfd052.webp?t=1740322085\" width=16 height=16 /></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620020/extras/8d974820097f342cc12a50306c8e2629.poster.avif?t=1740322085\" width=224 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620020/extras/8d974820097f342cc12a50306c8e2629.webm?t=1740322085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620020/extras/8d974820097f342cc12a50306c8e2629.mp4?t=1740322085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the dungeons and try to find and save the <strong>Queen Yuma</strong>... but wait: it's almost an impossible dungeon. And why? Because it's easy to say: you must move two knights at once!!! Are you ready to find and save tons of girls without dying?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620020/extras/b9a66927516ada218d1d16765e185282.poster.avif?t=1740322085\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620020/extras/b9a66927516ada218d1d16765e185282.webm?t=1740322085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620020/extras/b9a66927516ada218d1d16765e185282.mp4?t=1740322085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAIN FEATURES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time action game (like roguelike) with simple puzzle\u00a0solving mechanics;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 controller/keyboard allows the player to\u00a0move 2 characters\u00a0simultaneously;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 languages available (italian, english, french, german, spanish, japanese, simplified chinese, traditional chinese, russian);</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24 levels, 8 rest areas and 4 bosses;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 available\u00a0items (unlockable by winning) that allows you to boost your characters;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >96 girls to rescue across dungeons.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st