play muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620020/extras/8d974820097f342cc12a50306c8e2629.poster.avif?t=1740322085\" width=224 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620020/extras/8d974820097f342cc12a50306c8e2629.webm?t=1740322085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620020/extras/8d974820097f342cc12a50306c8e2629.mp4?t=1740322085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
